WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.336
This is Hisaab.

00:00:02.266 --> 00:00:06.684
Accounting for Indian businesses, with the
keys you know from TallyPrime.

00:00:06.614 --> 00:00:10.431
Your books stay on your own PC. No account.
Free.

00:00:10.631 --> 00:00:12.983
Switch from Tally in one step.

00:00:12.913 --> 00:00:16.063
Hisaab reads every master and every voucher,

00:00:15.992 --> 00:00:18.675
and proves that every balance matches.

00:00:18.976 --> 00:00:21.794
Press Enter, and the company comes over.

00:00:22.494 --> 00:00:25.778
The Proof of Match shows that every line
matches.

00:00:29.444 --> 00:00:33.463
A test with a real TallyPrime: 736 vouchers,

00:00:33.393 --> 00:00:36.811
switched in about 12 seconds, with a Proof of
Match.

00:00:37.111 --> 00:00:41.063
V opens the vouchers. F8 is a sales invoice.

00:00:41.101 --> 00:00:46.251
Type a part of a name, and press Enter: the
party, the items, the quantity.

00:00:46.725 --> 00:00:50.341
Hisaab calculates the GST from the rate of
each item.

00:00:53.775 --> 00:00:55.925
B opens the Balance Sheet.

00:00:56.626 --> 00:01:01.510
Enter goes deeper: to Profit and Loss, to the
stock, and to each item.

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:08.942
Your GST returns, GSTR-1 and GSTR-3B, come
straight from your vouchers.

00:01:09.242 --> 00:01:14.525
Alt G, GSTR-1: the new invoice is already in
the B2B table.

00:01:15.605 --> 00:01:18.956
Every day, Hisaab takes a backup by itself.

00:01:20.605 --> 00:01:24.624
With F9, Hisaab Drive keeps a copy in your own
cloud.

00:01:25.704 --> 00:01:29.320
Screens in Hindi or Gujarati, with the same
keys.

00:01:30.471 --> 00:01:34.087
Download Hisaab from the release page, and
start today.

